  <p class="browse-view-lens-note detail-muted">These totals count tricks by the modifier they use, so they will not match the grouping totals in <a href="/freestyle/tricks?view=movement-system">By movement system</a>, which sorts some of the same modifiers into different groups. The two are different lenses on the same tricks, not the same tally.</p>
